ry row operation ${R}_{1}↔{R}_{3},$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}I & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1}↔{R}_{3} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}0 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =A\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- The matrix $B$ is an elementary matrix because it can be obtained from $I$ by applying the elementary row operation ${R}_{2}:=(-3){R}_{2},$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}I & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :=(-3){R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =B\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- The matrix $C$ is not an elementary matrix because it can't be obtained from $I$ by applying only one elementary row operation.\n\nTherefore, only $A$ and $B$ are elementary matrices." 13194139533479 17592186045585 true] [17592186399699 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399700 13194139533479 17592186045585 true] [17592186399699 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399701 13194139533479 17592186045585 true] [17592186399699 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399702 13194139533479 17592186045585 true] [17592186399699 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399703 13194139533479 17592186045585 true] [17592186399699 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399704 13194139533479 17592186045585 true] [17592186399699 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533479 17592186045585 true] [17592186399699 1077 "selection" 13194139533479 17592186045585 true] [17592186399699 1079 #edb/ref 17592186399703 13194139533479 17592186045585 true] [17592186399699 1080 #uuid "27a779cd-5bb0-57e3-8fd6-1d037d1225d1" 13194139533479 17592186045585 true] [17592186399700 1081 "$A$ and $C$ only" 13194139533479 17592186045585 true] [17592186399700 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533479 17592186045585 true] [17592186399700 1084 #uuid "1ca0c6a8-b2d4-544c-89bf-7a6bdb87675a" 13194139533479 17592186045585 true] [17592186399701 1081 "$A$ only" 13194139533479 17592186045585 true] [17592186399701 1083 #edb/ref 175921860